flowchart TD
    %% Level 2 DFD: Decomposition of Process 2.0 - Process Orders
    %% Based on food ordering system examples
    %% Shows sub-processes within the main "Process Orders" function
    
    %% External Entities
    SR[Sales Representative]
    PA[Pharmacist/Admin]
    
    %% Sub-Processes of 2.0 Process Orders
    P2_1[2.1 Manage Shopping Cart<br/>Add/Update/Remove Items]
    P2_2[2.2 Create Order<br/>Convert Cart to Order]
    P2_3[2.3 Update Order Status<br/>Status Transitions]
    P2_4[2.4 Track Order History<br/>Status Timeline]
    
    %% Data Stores
    D2[(D2: Orders)]
    D3[(D3: Cart)]
    D4[(D4: Inventory)]
    D5[(D5: Prescriptions)]
    
    %% External Entity to Process Flows
    SR -->|Add to Cart| P2_1
    SR -->|Update Cart| P2_1
    SR -->|Remove from Cart| P2_1
    
    SR -->|Customer Information| P2_2
    SR -->|Create Order Request| P2_2
    
    PA -->|Status Update| P2_3
    PA -->|Status Change Request| P2_3
    
    SR -->|Order Query| P2_4
    PA -->|Order Query| P2_4
    
    %% Process to Data Store Flows
    P2_1 -->|Cart Items| D3
    P2_1 -->|Check Availability| D4
    D3 -->|Cart Data| P2_1
    D4 -->|Medicine Information| P2_1
    D4 -->|Stock Level| P2_1
    
    P2_2 -->|Order Data| D2
    P2_2 -->|Order Items| D2
    P2_2 -->|Clear Cart| D3
    P2_2 -->|Check Stock| D4
    P2_2 -->|Update Stock| D4
    P2_2 -->|Check Prescription| D5
    D3 -->|Cart Items| P2_2
    D4 -->|Medicine Information| P2_2
    D5 -->|Prescription Status| P2_2
    
    P2_3 -->|Order Status| D2
    P2_3 -->|Status History| D2
    P2_3 -->|Update Stock| D4
    D2 -->|Order Information| P2_3
    D4 -->|Stock Information| P2_3
    
    P2_4 -->|Read Orders| D2
    P2_4 -->|Read History| D2
    D2 -->|Order Data| P2_4
    D2 -->|Status History| P2_4
    
    %% Process to Process Flows
    P2_1 -->|Cart Ready| P2_2
    P2_2 -->|Order Created| P2_3
    P2_2 -->|Order Created| P2_4
    P2_3 -->|Status Changed| P2_4
    
    %% Process to External Entity Flows
    P2_1 -->|Cart Contents| SR
    P2_1 -->|Cart Total| SR
    P2_1 -->|Stock Status| SR
    
    P2_2 -->|Order Confirmation| SR
    P2_2 -->|Order Number| SR
    
    P2_3 -->|Status Updated| SR
    P2_3 -->|Status Updated| PA
    
    P2_4 -->|Order Details| SR
    P2_4 -->|Order Details| PA
    P2_4 -->|Status History| SR
    P2_4 -->|Status History| PA
    
    %% Styling
    classDef externalEntity fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0066cc,stroke-width:2px
    classDef process fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#00cc00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef dataStore fill:#e1ffe1,stroke:#00cc00,stroke-width:2px
    
    class SR,PA externalEntity
    class P2_1,P2_2,P2_3,P2_4 process
    class D2,D3,D4,D5 dataStore

